---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does every Dairy Queen serve breakfast?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. DQ breakfast is only available at select locations, primarily in the U.S. South and Midwest. Always verify breakfast availability with your local DQ before visiting."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What time does DQ breakfast end?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Breakfast is typically served until 10:30 AM, though exact hours vary by location. Some locations serve breakfast until 11:00 AM on weekends."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Breakfast Menu & Prices 2026 — Platters, Burr..." description="Complete DQ breakfast menu with 2026 prices. Country Breakfast Platter $6.99, Biscuit & Gravy $3.99, Breakfast Burritos, Pancake Platter, Hash Browns and more.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
<div class="container"><ol>
<li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li>
<li aria-current="page">Dairy Queen Breakfast Menu 2026</li>
</ol></div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-content">
<span class="hero-eyebrow">Select Locations · Served Until 10:30 AM</span>
<h1>Dairy Queen Breakfast Menu 2026</h1>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Dairy Queen Breakfast Menu — Complete 2026 Guide</h2>
    <p>While Dairy Queen is globally celebrated for Blizzards and Stackburgers, select <strong>DQ Grill &amp; Chill</strong> locations—primarily throughout the U.S. South, Texas, and the Midwest—serve a dedicated, scratch-made Southern comfort breakfast every morning.</p>
    <p>Unlike standard fast-food breakfast menus dominated by processed English muffins, DQ's morning menu revolves around fresh-baked buttermilk biscuits, country pork sausage, fluffy scrambled eggs, and Dairy Queen's signature black-peppered country white gravy.</p>

    <h2>2026 Breakfast Menu With Prices &amp; Calories</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Breakfast Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>What's Included</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.99</td><td>860 cal</td><td>Scrambled eggs, choice of bacon or sausage, hash browns, and biscuit &amp; gravy</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/ultimate-hash-browns-platter">Ultimate Hash Browns Platter</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.99</td><td>790 cal</td><td>Crisp hash browns loaded with scrambled eggs, sausage, cheddar &amp; country gravy</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/biscuit-gravy">Biscuit &amp; Country Gravy</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>400 cal</td><td>Warm, flaky Southern buttermilk biscuit smothered in rich peppered country gravy</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/breakfast-burrito">Loaded Breakfast Burrito</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>380 cal</td><td>Scrambled eggs, savory sausage or bacon, and melted cheddar in a warm flour tortilla</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/buttermilk-pancake-platter">Buttermilk Pancake Platter</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.49</td><td>680 cal</td><td>Stack of three golden buttermilk pancakes served with butter, maple syrup &amp; sausage</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>French Toast Platter</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.99</td><td>720 cal</td><td>Thick-cut cinnamon French toast slices with powdered sugar, syrup &amp; sausage</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Breakfast Hours &amp; Regional Availability Advisory</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Crucial Notice:</strong> DQ breakfast is franchise-operated and available only at participating stores (roughly 25–30% of U.S. locations). Always confirm with your local store or the DQ Mobile App before driving out.</li>
      <li><strong>Operating Hours:</strong> Breakfast is served daily from opening (typically 6:00 AM or 6:30 AM) until <strong>10:30 AM</strong> (often extended to 11:00 AM on Sundays).</li>
      <li><strong>Best Value Pick:</strong> The <a href="/items/breakfast-burrito">Breakfast Burrito</a> ($3.49 · 380 cal) delivers warm, portable morning protein at the lowest price on the breakfast board.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Does every Dairy Queen serve breakfast?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">No. Breakfast service is offered exclusively at select franchise locations, primarily across the Southern United States, Texas, and parts of the Midwest. The majority of coastal and urban walk-up locations do not serve breakfast.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What time does DQ breakfast end?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Participating locations conclude breakfast service promptly at 10:30 AM Monday through Saturday, with select stores extending service to 11:00 AM on Sunday mornings.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">
      For complete lunch, dinner, Blizzard, and cake menus, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
